1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,280
Moving through the meridians like that

25
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:29,320
consumes too much spiritual energy.

26
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:31,880
What ?

27
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:33,280
Master, are you crazy !?

28
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,240
If you drink a Desolate Beast's marrow essence,

29
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,040
you'll explode from the inside !

30
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,920
It's alright, you can explode then.

31
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,600
I don't care !

32
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:49,080
The first spell Ancient Gods learn

33
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,840
is the Ancient God Tactic.

34
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:53,440
The Ancient God Clan uses this method

35
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:56,760
to devour the spiritual energy of all things in the world.

36
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,280
No matter how much there is,

37
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:00,440
it can all be devoured.

38
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,960
That's the Ancient God Tactic.

39
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:11,240
Break !

40
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,920
I can't see through this person's cultivation.

41
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,520
But the feeling he gives me

42
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:28,360
is even more terrifying than a Soul Formation cultivator.

43
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,600
Still running away ?

44
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:33,800
Stop !

45
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,080
You dare to try to fly

46
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:43,800
through the meridians with a Core Formation cultivation.

47
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,840
You're quite bold, aren't you ?

48
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,000
Flood Dragon marrow essence...

49
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,280
Senior,

50
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,680
do you recognize this item ?

51
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,920
Back in the first trial,

52
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,560
I subdued a Flood Dragon.

53
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,680
When I was done playing with it,

54
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,560
I killed it for its marrow.

55
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,960
Nothing here can catch my eye.

56
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,160
I'm very disappointed.

57
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,840
The Flood Dragon in the first trial was too weak.

58
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,320
It seems that this is all the Land of the Ancient God

59
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,600
has to offer.

60
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:14,880
He's the one who left that writing !

61
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,200
Do you dare to consume Flood Dragon marrow essence

62
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,160
because you're a Soul Devourer ?

63
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,320
Yes !

64
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:21,640
Yes, my ass !

65
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,480
You were about to explode and die !

66
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,680
Is it also because you're a Soul Devourer that you can

67
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,840
move through the Ancient God's meridians ?

68
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,120
Yes.

69
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,600
Bullshit !

70
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,600
It's clearly because of the Ancient God's inheritance !

71
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:38,280
Come with me to greet Master.

72
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,360
If it weren't for my special authority,

73
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,120
even I wouldn't be able

74
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:52,120
to move freely within the Ancient God's meridians.

75
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,480
This brat

76
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,200
might be useful.

77
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,000
Duo Mu

78
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:36,320
pays respects to Master.

79
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,320
Kneel !

80
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,080
You talk too much.

81
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,400
I'm sorry, Master is right.

82
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,280
No spiritual energy fluctuations ?

83
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:58,000
I didn't even feel his Divine Sense ?

84
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,480
So this is pure

85
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,720
Ancient God power !

86
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:03,680
You...

87
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:05,800
Are you a Soul Devourer ?

88
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,440
Yes.

89
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,720
As expected...

90
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,040
Devour it.

91
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,480
Look at it !

92
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:02,040
A little brat

93
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,720
only took a few breaths

94
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,520
to break the seal that you trash

95
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,640
couldn't break for thousands of years !

96
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,960
In the next 10 years,

97
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:14,040
those who cannot refine the Divine Sense seal on their bodies

98
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:17,000
will serve no more purpose.

99
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,120
Inheritor,

100
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:30,760
you must never let my memory inheritance

101
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:33,400
fall in Tuo Sen's hands.

102
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,160
Remember... Remember...

103
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:40,360
The day the demon Tuo Sen breaks free

104
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,160
will be the day

105
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,560
all living beings shall suffer a calamity

106
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:49,000
But if I refuse to devour the seal,

107
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,800
I'm afraid he'll kill me on the spot.

108
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,280
This Soul Devourer is too young.

109
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,480
Make him condense a Soul Core

110
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,520
or he'll devour too slowly.

111
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,800
This subordinate is willing to lend a hand

112
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:06,160
to make the Soul Devourer condense a Soul Core.

113
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:08,960
Go...

114
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,240
Little guy,

115
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:33,200
when I caught you earlier,

116
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,640
what were you doing in the Dead Soul Sea ?

117
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:38,800
Senior, you're a Blood Sea Warrior,

118
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:42,360
why did you bring me to the Nirvana Space of the third trial

119
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:44,360
where Tuo Sen can't see us ?

120
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,680
Brat,

121
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:58,800
do you know how long it has been since someone spoke to me like that ?

122
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:04,600
Junior, you have some nerve.

123
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,000
We aren't really Blood Sea Warriors,

124
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,680
the eleven of us

125
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:13,080
are foreign cultivators trapped here by Tuo Sen.

126
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,280
In the past 1000 years,

127
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,960
only 3 people escaped.

128
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,880
Once Tuo Sen breaks the seal,

129
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,840
we will all die.

130
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,080
Now,

131
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,200
answer my question.

132
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,200
What were you doing ?

133
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,000
I tried to leave the Land of the Ancient God.

134
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,560
Did you all hear that ?

135
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,160
This little guy

136
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:53,040
has the same goal as us.

137
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,080
When he breaks Tuo Sen's seal,

138
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,600
it will be our moment to attack.

139
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,320
A Soul Devourer ?

140
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,480
Very good...

141
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,320
Little guy,

142
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:08,360
once you seal Tuo Sen again,

143
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:11,560
we will definitely reward you generously.

144
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,320
Senior, you're too kind.

145
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,880
But with my mere Core Formation cultivation,

146
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,040
sealing an Ancient God

147
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,480
is but a dream.

148
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:22,160
You won't use your cultivation to seal him.

149
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:25,080
The seal you will devour

150
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:27,320
is the Ancient God's Divine Sense.

151
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:29,840
You just need to use your Soul Devourer powers

152
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:32,720
when Tuo Sen enters the Dead Soul Sea

153
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:35,320
to trigger the Ancient God's Divine Sense to seal Tuo Sen again.

154
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,680
You can

155
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,680
leave the rest to us.

156
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,280
After we're done,

157
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:43,360
we will give you 100 top-quality spirit stones.

158
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,400
What ?

159
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,200
Are you not satisfied ?

160
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,960
I'll also give you a top tier artifact,

161
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,920
the Huan Yuan Beast Trap.

162
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,120
Is it enough now ?

163
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:57,920
Brat,

164
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,440
if you won't cooperate

165
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:06,560
then we will use another way without a Soul Devourer.

166
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:11,280
It's not that I don't trust you Seniors

167
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:13,640
but this is a matter of life or death,

168
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,920
I need a guarantee from you.

169
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,160
What do you want ?

170
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,800
I want your life artifacts.

171
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:23,520
You !

172
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,520
It's alright.

173
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,240
After all this is done,

174
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:29,280
Junior will give them back to you.

175
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,880
I'm sure Seniors

176
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,520
wouldn't worry about a Core Formation Junior like me

177
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:36,640
being able to steal your artifacts for myself, right ?

178
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:24,480
This is a Soul Core.

179
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,480
Swallow it

180
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:30,200
and you'll be able to break Tuo Sen's seal.

181
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,840
This day

182
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:45,040
has finally come...

183
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,520
A Divine Sense barrier ?

184
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,080
Tu Si,

185
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,720
you couldn't beat me 10 000 years ago.

186
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,120
Now

187
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,680
is no different !

188
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,840
I, Tuo Sen,

189
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,520
am back !

190
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:43,080
Tu Si is dead.

191
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,640
On Tu Si's behalf,

192
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:48,840
I summon his life artifact.

193
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,400
Star Destroyer Spear,

194
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:52,960
appear...

195
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,720
I order everyone

196
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:22,240
to follow me to obtain

197
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,560
the Ancient God's memory inheritance !

198
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:13,280
Your life artifact, the Star Destroyer Spear

199
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:14,960
has already submitted to me.

200
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:16,680
Tu Si,

201
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,560
you cannot stop me !

202
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:23,800
Passage to the Ancient God's memories...

203
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,520
Appear !

204
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:46,280
Duo Mu and the others' positions seem random

205
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,520
but in reality they surrounded Tuo Sen.

206
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:52,200
Are they that confident in dealing with him ?

207
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:57,280
Little guy,

208
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:59,080
why aren't you moving ?

209
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,360
Senior doesn't need to be so cautious.

210
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:04,000
My cultivation is limited

211
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:05,160
so I'm a little slow.

212
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,720
Senior, I won't delay your plan.

213
00:17:11,390 --> 00:19:33,860
The Soul Core increases a Soul Devourer's power and also strengthens its control over wandering souls. It is generally formed by devouring a huge amount of souls right after becoming a Soul Devourer. Wang Lin didn't form one because he left the Foreign Battlefield too early after becoming a Soul Devourer.

214
00:17:40,330 --> 00:17:47,210
Count the specks of time

215
00:17:44,210 --> 00:17:47,210
floating down gently.

216
00:17:47,570 --> 00:17:53,450
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

217
00:17:54,570 --> 00:18:00,970
Forever lock away the scars

218
00:17:58,370 --> 00:18:00,970
of this mortal life.

219
00:18:01,230 --> 00:18:07,490
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

220
00:18:08,130 --> 00:18:15,210
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

221
00:18:10,810 --> 00:18:15,210
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

222
00:18:15,290 --> 00:18:22,370
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

223
00:18:17,330 --> 00:18:22,370
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

224
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:24,890
I will ask the heavens who exactly

225
00:18:24,890 --> 00:18:29,650
sliced open this world

226
00:18:26,290 --> 00:18:29,650
to let the rain fall in.

227
00:18:29,650 --> 00:18:31,650
I will refine the world

228
00:18:31,730 --> 00:18:34,170
to make our palm lines say

229
00:18:34,370 --> 00:18:36,530
that we will live forever.

230
00:18:36,530 --> 00:18:39,450
Walking off the beaten path

231
00:18:39,450 --> 00:18:42,530
through heaven and earth.

232
00:18:43,810 --> 00:18:49,490
Before returning to dust,

233
00:18:45,730 --> 00:18:49,490
I will refine this mortal body.

234
00:18:51,010 --> 00:18:58,370
The left shore is the joyous laughter

235
00:18:54,890 --> 00:18:58,370
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

236
00:18:58,370 --> 00:19:04,970
The right shore is an eternal silence

237
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:04,970
lingering under the candlelight.

238
00:19:05,170 --> 00:19:07,850
To overturn this fate,

239
00:19:07,850 --> 00:19:12,210
I will walk against the heavens.

240
00:19:12,650 --> 00:19:19,370
I will even gather the clouds

241
00:19:15,170 --> 00:19:19,370
to illuminate the sky for you.

242
00:19:19,770 --> 00:19:23,610
All this sadness was not meaningless.

243
00:19:23,610 --> 00:19:26,930
How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?

244
00:19:26,930 --> 00:19:32,730
I vow to break

245
00:19:29,170 --> 00:19:32,730
this chess game of fate.

246
00:19:34,050 --> 00:19:43,690
I vow to break

247
00:19:35,850 --> 00:19:43,690
this chess game of fate.
